  "description": "HackTheStack — 2-Day Hackathon Get ready for HackTheStack, a 2-day student hackathon at Bharati Vidyapeeth Institute of Management & Research (BVIMR), Delhi NCR, bringing together developers, designers, innovators, and problem-solvers to build impactful solutions for real-world challenges. Day 1 — Speaker & Networking Session: Kickstart the experience with an interactive speaker session featuring industry professionals. Insights from experienced speakers Learn about emerging technologies and industry trends Network with speakers, mentors, and fellow participants Exchange ideas and prepare for the main hackathon Day 2 — The Main Hackathon: A full day of building, collaborating, and innovating! 9:00 AM – 9:45 AM: Offline check-in & onboarding 9:45 AM – 1:00 PM: Hacking begins 1:00 PM – 1:30 PM: Lunch break 1:30 PM – 4:30 PM: Hacking continues 4:30 PM – 6:00 PM: Results & prize announcement Prize Pool — ₹1,00,000: 1st Prize: ₹50,000 2nd Prize: ₹30,000 3rd Prize: ₹20,000 Goodies for all shortlisted participants! HackTheStack is more than a competition — it's an opportunity to learn, build, connect, and showcase your ideas while solving meaningful problems through technology. Whether you're a developer, designer, innovator, or someone with a great idea, come build something that matters.",
