    "details": "<p><strong>HackTheStack &mdash; 2-Day Hackathon</strong></p>\n<p>Get ready for HackTheStack, a 2-day student hackathon at Bharati Vidyapeeth Institute of Management &amp; Research (BVIMR), Delhi NCR, bringing together developers, designers, innovators, and problem-solvers to build impactful solutions for real-world challenges.</p>\n<p><strong>Day 1 &mdash; Speaker &amp; Networking Session:</strong></p>\n<p>Kickstart the experience with an interactive speaker session featuring industry professionals.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Insights from experienced speakers</li>\n<li>Learn about emerging technologies and industry trends</li>\n<li>Network with speakers, mentors, and fellow participants</li>\n<li>Exchange ideas and prepare for the main hackathon</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Day 2 &mdash; The Main Hackathon:</strong></p>\n<p>A full day of building, collaborating, and innovating!</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>9:00 AM &ndash; 9:45 AM:</strong> Offline check-in &amp; onboarding</li>\n<li><strong>9:45 AM &ndash; 1:00 PM:</strong> Hacking begins</li>\n<li><strong>1:00 PM &ndash; 1:30 PM:</strong> Lunch break</li>\n<li><strong>1:30 PM &ndash; 4:30 PM:</strong> Hacking continues</li>\n<li><strong>4:30 PM &ndash; 6:00 PM:</strong> Results &amp; prize announcement</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Prize Pool &mdash; ₹1,00,000:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1st Prize:</strong> ₹50,000</li>\n<li><strong>2nd Prize:</strong> ₹30,000</li>\n<li><strong>3rd Prize:</strong> ₹20,000</li>\n<li>Goodies for all shortlisted participants!</li>\n</ul>\n<p>HackTheStack is more than a competition &mdash; it's an opportunity to learn, build, connect, and showcase your ideas while solving meaningful problems through technology.</p>\n<p>Whether you're a developer, designer, innovator, or someone with a great idea, come build something that matters.</p>",
